# Docker build context exclusions
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/.env
.git

# P7 (MVP-7.3): local first-run workarounds must not enter the build context.
# docker/certs/ (official Russian Trusted CA certs) IS needed by the backend
# image and stays included.
/certs
docker-compose.override.yml
